      "content": "thanks. so you're saying it's basically just about being kind and respecting their truth. but what if my kid starts asking questions about the biological side of it? like if they ask why someone wouldn't want to be a boy or a girl if they were born that way? how do i handle that without making things confusing or making it seem like biology doesnt matter?",
