      "content": "okay but i feel like that might be a bit confusing for a 7 year old... if i tell them that feelings matter more than what science says about bodies, aren't i basically telling them that biological reality isn't actually true? i'm worried that by teaching them this 'correct' way, i'm just teaching them to ignore facts in favor of social trends. isn't there a more balanced way to do this that doesn't just take one side?",
